        "detailed_description": "<h1>Play Ballshit</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a storyboard version of <i>Ballshit</i>! You can experience the game's full storyline for free—this is the redemption journey of the protagonist, &quot;Eggy&quot; If you want to see the story brought to life with live actors, search for <i>Ballshit</i> on STEAM to purchase and experience it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047760/extras/a1c68debc5cf7b3e7f3f59fe44f7b4e6.avif?t=1766072918\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Ah~ How did I turn into a girl!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Maybe if I sleep it off, I’ll wake up normal again~”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jia Xu, a shut-in college streamer nicknamed “DanDan,” is mysteriously transformed into a cute girl overnight in the boys’ dorm—and his ridiculous new life begins! Armed with nothing but hormones and confusion, you’ll face your stunned roommates, your lifelong bros, their suddenly awkward girlfriends, and other unlucky classmates who’ve shared the same fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will this farce ever end? Can DanDan change back, or is an even crazier future waiting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047760/extras/72763dc1bd0aed5aadf9cbc87ed3b2d8.avif?t=1766072918\" width=877 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art that drags you into the absurdity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 000+ words of wild campus comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally FREE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprite, CG and chibi drawn by a single over-caffeinated developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and more surprises hidden inside!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Ah~ How did I turn into a girl!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Maybe if I sleep it off, I’ll wake up normal again~”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jia Xu, a shut-in college streamer nicknamed “DanDan,” is mysteriously transformed into a cute girl overnight in the boys’ dorm—and his ridiculous new life begins! Armed with nothing but hormones and confusion, you’ll face your stunned roommates, your lifelong bros, their suddenly awkward girlfriends, and other unlucky classmates who’ve shared the same fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will this farce ever end? Can DanDan change back, or is an even crazier future waiting?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047760/extras/72763dc1bd0aed5aadf9cbc87ed3b2d8.avif?t=1766072918\" width=877 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art that drags you into the absurdity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 000+ words of wild campus comedy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally FREE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sprite, CG and chibi drawn by a single over-caffeinated developer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…and more surprises hidden inside!</p>",
